{"t":"010130.KS","n":"Korea Zinc Company, Ltd.","nKo":"고려아연","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":755000.0,"chg":28000.0,"chgPct":0.03851,"prev":727000.0,"dayH":764000.0,"dayL":730000.0,"w52H":2188000.0,"w52L":712000.0,"vol":11174,"avgVol":19592,"mcap":15396890476544,"pe":null,"fpe":16.59,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":35000.0,"divY":0.0481,"beta":0.77,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Other Industrial Metals & Mining","iKo":"기타 산업용 금속 및 광업","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.koreazinc.co.kr","sum":"Korea Zinc Company, Ltd. operates as a general non-ferrous metal smelting company primarily in South Korea. The company offers zinc slab ingots, alloy jumbo blocks, anode ingots, and die cast ingots; and lead and lead alloy ingots; and copper cathodes. The company also provides gold and silver; and rare metals, including indium, bismuth, antimony, cadmium, tellurium, and cobalt; and sulfuric acid, semiconductor sulfuric acid, and oleum. In addition, it engages in non-ferrous metals import and export, and recycling; wholesale and commodity brokerage; warehousing services; shipping; construction equipment; manufacturing of industrial robot; resource recirculation; electricity, gas, and steam supply; renewable energy; wind power; hydrogen development; mining development; and logistics busines","sumKo":"고려아연주식회사는 주로 한국에서 종합 비철금속 제련회사로 활동하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 아연 슬래브 잉곳, 합금 점보 블록, 양극 잉곳 및 다이캐스트 잉곳을 제공합니다. 납 및 납 합금 잉곳; 그리고 구리 음극. 회사는 또한 금과 은을 제공합니다. 인듐, 비스무트, 안티몬, 카드뮴, 텔루르, 코발트를 포함한 희귀 금속; 황산, 반도체황산, 발연황산 등을 들 수 있다. 또한 비철금속 수출입, 재활용 사업도 하고 있습니다. 도매 및 상품 중개; 창고 서비스; 해운; 건설 장비; 산업용 로봇 제조; 자원 재순환; 전기, 가스, 증기 공급; 재생에너지; 풍력; 수소개발; 광산 개발; 및 물류사업"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":8081378000000,"ni":656194000000},{"y":2023,"rev":7291069000000,"ni":585595000000},{"y":2024,"rev":8089017000000,"ni":456238000000},{"y":2025,"rev":16581246000000,"ni":780828000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":